Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.40,0:00:02.44,Default,,0,0,150,,Coming up on {\i1}Punirunes...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.36,0:00:05.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Squishy squishy, puni puni\NPunirunes! (Rune-rune!)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.03,0:00:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Squishy squishy, pet it, take care of it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.45,0:00:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Squishy squishy, puni puni\NPunirunes! (Rune-rune!)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.74,0:00:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Let's play, Punirunes!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.74,0:00:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The show is squishing!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.79,0:00:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Punirunes. Before we knew it, these creatures\Nbegan to inhabit the human world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.75,0:00:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,They're squishsterious and soft to the touch!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.92,0:00:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,They all love to be squished.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.34,0:00:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Sometimes they're kachi-freezy and hard too!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.26,0:00:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,These are some merry, adorable puni-pals.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.89,0:00:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knows, there could be\Na Punirune right next to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.15,0:00:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,"Puni School is In Session{\fnSegoe UI Symbol}♪{\fnAvenir LT Std 65 Medium}"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.07,0:00:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm home!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.95,0:00:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.32,0:00:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomorune!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.62,0:00:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You're back from your travels?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.00,0:01:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}This little one is Tomorune.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.08,0:01:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's a traveling Punirune\Nwho loves to travel and has many puni-pals.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.30,0:01:08.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, where's Airune?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.93,0:01:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Where did you come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.39,0:01:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Would you believe it? Airune...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.98,0:01:24.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}snuck into Yuka's backpack\Nand went to school with her all day!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.56,0:01:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Really? I didn't notice at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.74,0:01:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Airune found school so much fun,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.66,0:01:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}it wants to make a school in Puniland too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.54,0:01:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,School can be fun, but you also\Nhave to study and do homework.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.62,0:01:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.67,0:01:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Everyone's raring to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.22,0:01:55.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Now, off to Puniland!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.97,0:02:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Let's build the school here."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.44,0:02:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It looks like Airune is having\NUrurune draw a school.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.87,0:02:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Hmm... Not quite right."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.13,0:02:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But how will you build it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.82,0:02:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's done in a flash!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.16,0:03:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Now, let's puni-open up the Punirunes school Puni School!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.47,0:03:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Rise!"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.52,0:03:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Bow!"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.69,0:03:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Take your seat."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.98,0:03:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}First period is puni-language with Mx. Airune.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.15,0:03:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Please open your textbooks\Nto page 22 and read."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.37,0:03:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Loverune."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.52,0:04:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"This isn't music class, silly-billies."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.32,0:04:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Second period is puni-math with Mx. Coolrune.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.16,0:04:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Today, we'll be learning gum-metic\Nusing gummies."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.21,0:04:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Two plus three plus..."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.63,0:04:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"four plus..."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.63,0:04:41.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"one... What is it?"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.97,0:04:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"One!"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.85,0:04:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"One?!"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.15,0:04:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Don't eat them!"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.28,0:05:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's finally lunch time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.83,0:05:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Lunch duty Ururune announces\Nthere's only one puning left.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.88,0:05:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is a battle no one can afford to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.51,0:05:22.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Puning Scramble Rock-Paper-Scissors!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.39,0:05:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Rock, paper, scissors!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.32,0:05:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Um, hey! It's getting late...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.11,0:05:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}After lunch, it's recess.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.49,0:05:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Time for dodgeball on the playground!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.67,0:05:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Airune, you're out!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.21,0:05:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nazorune, you're out!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.72,0:06:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sushirune, you're... out?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.32,0:06:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sushirune, you're safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.74,0:06:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I know you're sleepy after\Nlunch and recess,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.62,0:06:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but you have to wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.87,0:06:38.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Third period is puni-science with Mx. Loverune.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.81,0:06:55.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"We will be learning about animals,\Nstarting with cats."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.52,0:07:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nekorune's the cat here...?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.11,0:07:05.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"This is its stomach."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.99,0:07:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"This is its ear."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.50,0:07:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"That ends our lesson."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.10,0:07:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Time for the final class.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.98,0:07:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Fourth period is puni-social studies\Nwith Mx. Tomorune.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.98,0:07:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mx. Tomorune's a traveling Punirune,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.28,0:07:50.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}so it'll be teaching Punirunes history\Nit learned across Puniland.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.66,0:07:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"The history of Punirunes goes back a long, long time."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.92,0:08:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"An eternity ago, in ancient Puniland,"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.92,0:08:04.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"lived the purun-squey Purunes,"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.51,0:08:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"and the nirun-ishy Nirunes."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.97,0:08:16.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"The Purunes and Nirunes helped\None another and became good friends."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.10,0:08:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"However..."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.31,0:08:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"With the rage of the skies, the breaking\Nof the ground, and the passage of time..."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.48,0:08:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Purunes,"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.48,0:08:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Nirunes..."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.24,0:08:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Rune!"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.32,0:08:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Punirunes!"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.79,0:08:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Whether you believe it or not\Nis up to you..."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.04,0:08:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Puni."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.04,0:08:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It was just an urban legend?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.80,0:08:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"School was so much fun!"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.06,0:09:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"See you tomorrow!"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.70,0:09:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome back, Airune!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.66,0:09:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,How was school?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.08,0:09:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.12,0:09:25.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You have a lot of math homework? That's rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.92,0:09:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Ten minus three..."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.22,0:09:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"I have to eat three of them.\NThat's what's rough!"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.10,0:09:36.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that really homework?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.27,0:09:48.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Puni-Pal Files!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.19,0:09:50.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Today, I'll tell you about...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.53,0:09:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Loverune!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.49,0:09:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Loverune is super cute and full of big love!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.41,0:10:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's popular with everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.75,0:10:13.43,Default,,0,0,0,,But when it's a mediator for the others,\Nit can be very strict!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.30,0:10:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Time for the Puni-Pal Squestion!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.76,0:10:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What appears when Loverune winks after this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.10,0:10:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,427.33)}1. Tears
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.52,0:10:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,686)}2. Scales
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.90,0:10:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,944.67)}3. Hearts
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.36,0:10:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's the answer!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.03,0:10:38.03,Default,,0,0,0,,3. Hearts!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.10,0:11:50.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kachikochiland's got a festival in store
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.69,0:11:53.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}There'll be dancing and vendors galore
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.57,0:11:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Jewelrune wants to bring the party alive
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.07,0:11:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Get the Kachi-Freezy Festival's gear into drive
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.78,0:12:01.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}There's one puni-pal who's a perfect fit
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.49,0:12:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The music-lover Otorune's here to play the hits
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.20,0:12:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A little mischief-maker joins in too, yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.46,0:12:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time: "Otorune and the Kachi-Freezy Festival{\fnSegoe UI Symbol}♪{\fnAvenir LT Std 65 Medium}"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.09,0:12:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,"Puni" in next time!
